  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chihuahua: Advisory on Low-Carbon Industrial Park, VCM and green finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop quality technical reports (3) to show a clear implemehntation roadmap regarding industrial decarbonization, voluntary carbon pricing mechanismsand access to financial mechanisms.</narrative>
